<msContents>
<summary>Marriage contract of the dowry of Tamet daughter of Meshullan son of Zaccur. Made between Ananiah son of Azariah and Meshullam. Unique is an addemdum discussing the rights to Tamet's son Pilti. Ananiah is a Judean priestly servant at Elephantine and Tamet is an Aramean of Syene.</summary>
